fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"cuda/gstcudacontext.html#gst_cuda_context_find_dxgi_adapter_luid","fragment":"\n\tgst_cuda_context_find_dxgi_adapter_luid\n\n\n\tGstCuda.CudaContext.prototype.find_dxgi_adapter_luid\n\n\n\tGstCuda.CudaContext.find_dxgi_adapter_luid\n\nFinds the DXGI adapter LUID corresponding to the given CUDA device.\nThis is useful for matching CUDA devices with Direct3D adapters on Windows.\nParameters:\na CUDA device index\nThe DXGI adapter LUID or 0 if not found or on non-Windows platforms\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28.2\n\t\t\nFinds the DXGI adapter LUID corresponding to the given CUDA device.\nThis is useful for matching CUDA devices with Direct3D adapters on Windows.\nParameters:\na CUDA device index\nThe DXGI adapter LUID or 0 if not found or on non-Windows platforms\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28.2\n\t\t\nFinds the DXGI adapter LUID corresponding to the given CUDA device.\nThis is useful for matching CUDA devices with Direct3D adapters on Windows.\nParameters:\na CUDA device index\nThe DXGI adapter LUID or 0 if not found or on non-Windows platforms\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28.2\n\t\t\n"});